silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#cannonwitness a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#cannonwitness" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#cannonwitness silm:hasLongDescription "The CannonWitness is the Mittens body-mass observation record from the May 2026 vet visit at Tartu Animal Clinic, entering the engine as a typed quality-claim source packet. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{CannonWitness} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#musicolog a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#musicolog" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#musicolog silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicOlog is the Mittens vaccination record FVRCP-2026-03-15, entering as a typed evidence packet with provenance and validation envelope. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{MusicOlog} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#publishedclaim a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#publishedclaim" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#publishedclaim silm:hasLongDescription "The PublishedClaim is the Mittens microchip-id witness 985112000123456 entering as a typed identifier source leg into the Music engine cocone. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{PublishedClaim}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#generatedwitness a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#generatedwitness" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#generatedwitness silm:hasLongDescription "The GeneratedWitness is the Mittens coat-pattern observation (torbie, three-color) entering as a typed quality-claim into the manifest profile reader. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{GeneratedWitness} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#_ a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#_" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#_ silm:hasLongDescription "The \\ is the Mittens domestic-cat classification leg (DomesticCat) as a typed source-leg arrow that anchors BY Mittens, not as an identity. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#musicengine a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#musicengine" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#musicengine silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicEngine is the Felis catus / TSN 183798 taxonomy source leg, recoverable as a typed leg into D_Mittens but not interchangeable with the colimit apex Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{MusicEngine} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#mittens a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#mittens" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The Mittens is the ShapeGate that validates the body-mass measurement schema (kg, range 2-12) before admission to the task node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#joycatsthreshold a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#joycatsthreshold" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#joycatsthreshold silm:hasLongDescription "The JoyCatsThreshold is the TaskNode that records the admitted body-mass measurement as the engine's executable transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{JoyCatsThreshold}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#absorbedsource a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#absorbedsource" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#absorbedsource silm:hasLongDescription "The AbsorbedSource is the TraceWitness emitted from the body-mass measurement task, the outgoing-profile representative of the typed work. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{AbsorbedSource} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#typednode a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#typednode" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#typednode silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedNode is the ChunkManifest profiling the music-entry task — a Yoneda-profile reader for incoming and outgoing arrows of the engine apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{TypedNode} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#ologleg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#ologleg" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#ologleg silm:hasLongDescription "The OlogLeg is the SourceWitness from the cannon/cat/joy_of_cats.md JoC §11 colimit citation, an external authority source leg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{OlogLeg}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#incomingprofile a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#incomingprofile" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#incomingprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The IncomingProfile is the EvidencePacket carrying the typing decision and path law that admits the Mittens vaccination record, distinct from the raw audio file or storage object. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{IncomingProfile}  \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#validationtrace a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#validationtrace" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#validationtrace silm:hasLongDescription "The ValidationTrace is the AvroPacket serializing a Mittens body-mass observation as a typed record schema, licensed by the AvroSchema for transport. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ValidationTrace} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#outgoingprofile a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#outgoingprofile" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#outgoingprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The OutgoingProfile is the AvroRecord as a schema-layer transport node (silver schemanode), distinct from the colimit apex Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{OutgoingProfile}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
