silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#musicnode_15 silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicNode_15 is the KGEdge (Mittens, hasQuality, BodyMass) admitted to the engine via the typed olog arrow hasQuality. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'concept{MusicNode_15}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
