silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#musicnode_16 silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicNode_16 is the KGNode for Mittens-the-cat as a knowledge-graph reference distinct from the categorical apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'concept{MusicNode_16}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#musicnode_17 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#musicnode_17" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#musicnode_17 silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicNode_17 is the OlogLeg arrow that the Mittens body-mass observation flows through on its way to the published quality section. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'concept{MusicNode_17}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
